<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back off mkt at NZ$7.11.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back off mkt at NZ$7.11.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday it had acquired 27,988 shares off-market on Tuesday at NZ$7.11 each, pursuant to its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>The current phase of Telecom's buyback is expected to continue until the company gives notice that it is completed.</p>
<p>Telecom's shares are currently up six cents at $7.25.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
